                "<tr><td><strong>Core Moral Focus</strong></td><td>Extending equal rights to all members of the community (both non-human and human).</td><td>Recognizing the fundamental interdependence and relational bonds of all biological entities.</td></tr>\n"
                "<tr><td><strong>Individual vs Systemic</strong></td><td>Centers on protecting individual sentient organisms from harm, exploitation, and cruelty.</td><td>Centers on the health, balance, and continuity of whole biotic and abiotic cycles.</td></tr>\n"
