                "<tr><td><strong>Resolution of Ethical Conflicts</strong></td><td>Opposes harming an individual animal even if an ecosystem is altered (rights cannot be violated).</td><td>Supports managing individual populations (e.g. culling invasive herds) to preserve overall ecosystem health.</td></tr>\n"
