                "<br>• <em>Criterion 1 (Unique Ecological Wetland):</em> Largest brackish lagoon in the subcontinent with a dynamic marine-estuarine-freshwater hydrological gradient.\n"
                "<br>• <em>Criterion 2 (Threatened Species Refuge):</em> Critical refuge for the vulnerable <strong>Irrawaddy dolphin (Orcaella brevirostris)</strong> and fishing cat.\n"
